  {
    "hotel_id": "2262064",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/continent-hotel-danang/hotel/da-nang-vn.html",
    "name": "Continent Hotel Danang",
    "detail": "The hotel is just open 5 months but everything is so great and professional that is more than our expectation. The staff from reception to restaurant are so friendly and helpful, they consulted us very in detail what should we do and we go. They booked for us the ticket to 3D Art museum in Da Nang and ticket for bus to Hue at the very good price. When we checked in late afternoon, my kid was hungry, the bell man went to buy the food for my kid quickly without service charge. Room are so nice, furniture is high standard. Breakfast is delicious and quite various for Vietnamese and Western tastes. The price for car rental to Hoi An and Ba Na hill are reasonable. Overall is great, we will stay here next year when come back Da Nang. ",
